# ai-os — PUBLIC repository. No private user data, ever.
#
# The private user workspace lives at ~/.ai-os and is a separate, local-only git
# repository. It must never appear here. These entries are a safety net, not the
# mechanism — the real separation is that the two live in different trees, and
# `ai-os workspace status` / `ai-os-doctor` check for violations.

# --- private workspace, if it is ever copied or symlinked in by mistake ---
.ai-os/
**/.ai-os/

# --- credentials ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
credentials.json
secrets.json
.netrc
.npmrc

# --- OS / editor ---
.DS_Store
._*
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json

# --- build / deps ---
node_modules/
dist/
build/
coverage/
*.log
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# --- NOT ignored, deliberately ---
# Nested .git directories are NOT ignored. Ignoring one would hide it; we want a nested
# repository to be found and reported, not silently excluded. ai-os-doctor fails loudly
# on any unexpected nested repository.
